<programme start="20261117123400 +0000" stop="20261117125500 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Indefensible: A Few Bad Men</sub-title><desc lang="en">A man with a violent criminal history is imprisoned after he nearly kills his girlfriend; just months after he&apos;s released early on parole, he finds himself at the center of another tragic case.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
