<programme start="20261117133800 +0000" stop="20261117135900 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Indefensible: Helen &amp; Olga</sub-title><desc lang="en">Two elderly women in Los Angeles seem to pull off the perfect murder; when they try to pull it off again nearly six years later, things don&apos;t go as planned.</desc><credits><actor>Jena Friedman</actor></credits><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
