<programme start="20261118233000 +0000" stop="20261119013000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">IU-Indianapolis at Penn State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Penn State Nittany Lions (4-1) host the IU Indianapolis Jaguars (3-1) at Bryce Jordan Center. IU Indianapolis fell 79-75 and relies on Gus Etchison, while Penn State seeks to make it three straight following an 86-52 win over New Haven.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261119013000 +0000" stop="20261119033000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">South Dakota at Nebraska</sub-title><desc lang="en">The South Dakota Coyotes (2-4) travel to Lincoln to face the No. 25 Nebraska Cornhuskers (4-0) at Pinnacle Bank Arena. South Dakota enters after a 81-57 victory over Doane, while Nebraska is on a four-game win streak and looks to Pryce Sandfort.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261119033000 +0000" stop="20261119053000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Cal State Fullerton at UCLA</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Cal State Fullerton Titans play the UCLA Bruins at Pauley Pavilion for an NCAA matchup. Cal State Fullerton sits at 2-1 and beat Lincoln (CA) 101-71 behind Joshua Ward, while UCLA relies on Nikola Kusturica who leads the team in points per game.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
