<programme start="20261117213000 +0000" stop="20261117233000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Notre Dame vs. Florida</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Fighting Irish (4-0) take on the No. 1 Gators (4-0) at Michelob Ultra Arena. Both teams enter undefeated. Notre Dame comes in after beating South Carolina State 99-59 behind 36 points from Ethan Roberts, while Florida topped Merrimack 83-54.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
